{"3538070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greed & Darkness", "steam_appid": 3538070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/e754b075307f8f6b7ce6973ca78e5770.avif?t=1785761512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras_big/e754b075307f8f6b7ce6973ca78e5770.avif?t=1785761512 width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mind your surroundings! Keep an ear out for strange noises, and be on the lookout for signs that you’re walking into a trap. Spatial audio allows you to hear the direction of monsters or special items in nearby rooms.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/7a3f6f5bc036767f84561241c77cb71a.poster.avif?t=1785761512\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/7a3f6f5bc036767f84561241c77cb71a.webm?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/7a3f6f5bc036767f84561241c77cb71a.mp4?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/d73ebfd39de952708ec09cba306e73cd.avif?t=1785761512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras_big/d73ebfd39de952708ec09cba306e73cd.avif?t=1785761512 width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The oppressive darkness can be both your foe and your ally. Lighting your torch lets you peer into the next room and see what dangers lurk ahead, and extinguishing it will let you sneak past them. But take care not to reignite it at the wrong moment, lest ye be spotted by the creatures stalking the dungeon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/b54fb36a855505c59321d32545e7e635.poster.avif?t=1785761512\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/b54fb36a855505c59321d32545e7e635.webm?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/b54fb36a855505c59321d32545e7e635.mp4?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/1424518687016a7c112b77dd5fca0f00.avif?t=1785761512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras_big/1424518687016a7c112b77dd5fca0f00.avif?t=1785761512 width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The vast, winding tunnels are riddled with puzzles and clues, beckoning you to explore further and further. Discover the secrets of The Gorge Fortress and uncover its ancient treasures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6585d68651eda7a84ea35755ccaac667.poster.avif?t=1785761512\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6585d68651eda7a84ea35755ccaac667.webm?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6585d68651eda7a84ea35755ccaac667.mp4?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/1988048474f73f0671aef4ecafd591a4.avif?t=1785761512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras_big/1988048474f73f0671aef4ecafd591a4.avif?t=1785761512 width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The halls of Gorge Fortress are crawling with minions of the dungeon’s sleeping master. Tread lightly, and take care not to let them bring him word of your intrusion. Once you hear the rumbling of the Gorged One, it may already be too late for you...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6b1a7cc32016f8b2ed6117218fa6e389.poster.avif?t=1785761512\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6b1a7cc32016f8b2ed6117218fa6e389.webm?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/6b1a7cc32016f8b2ed6117218fa6e389.mp4?t=1785761512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras/e754b075307f8f6b7ce6973ca78e5770.avif?t=1785761512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538070/extras_big/e754b075307f8f6b7ce6973ca78e5770.avif?t=1785761512 width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"b